      ],
      "content": "SP 81 SE          BUCKLAND                    BUCKLAND VILLAGE                                               west side 5/52                                          Havering House II House. Early C18, red brick with blue headers, old tiled roof with end chimneys and 2 flat roofed dormers, plaster coved eaves cornice. 2-storeys, 1st floor brick band, 3 bays of 3-light transomed leaded casements, segmental arched heads to ground floor, central door in modern open gabled porch, 2-light casement above. C20 flanking wings with lower roof line, 1 bay, 3-light casements to LH., door and 2-light casement to RH. Listing NGR: SP8863612824"
    }
